  "prompt": "Return sku, quantity, event_id for the latest valid dated observation per non-NULL SKU. valid must be TRUE and observed_at must not be NULL. Latest observed_at wins; ties use greatest event_id. quantity may be NULL (unknown) or zero and must be preserved. Exact events can replay; IDs have no conflicting payloads. Omit SKUs without any eligible observation.",
